  n54 [label="#54 nCr(-((k ^ 3)),(-((k ^ 3)) + -(k))) = nCr(-((k ^ 3)),(-((k ^ 3)) + -((-((k ^ 3)) + -(k))))) assuming -((k ^ 3)) >= 0 and (-((k ^ 3)) + -(k)) >= 0 and (-((k ^ 3)) + -(k)) <= -((k ^ 3))\nLEMMA_FOUND"];
